{%- comment -%}
  theinmag-review-form
  Built 22 Sep 2026. Hosts the Judge.me Review Widget as an app block so the
  per-order review links Klaviyo sends (?judgeme_review_source=...&judgeme_token=...)
  have a form to open. Without a Review Widget on the product page, Judge.me's
  token handler has nothing to target and the link silently does nothing.

  Placement: directly after theinmag-membership-reviews on the mag PDP
  (product.json) and the membership PDP (product.membership.json). Same white
  surface, so the two read as one editorial chapter: the reviews list above,
  "write yours" below.

  form_only (default on): both PDPs already render the pooled store reviews in
  theinmag-membership-reviews, so this section hides the widget's own list,
  summary, histogram, sort and pagination, keeping only the write-a-review
  button and the form. Turn it off to show Judge.me's full widget.

  Fallback: if the template carries no app block (app removed, block never
  added), the section renders Judge.me's documented Liquid markup for the same
  widget so the token link still works. The app embed hydrates either.

  Type: Inter only. Small uppercase Inter 700 heading, the same Atari-mimic
  register as the reviews section above (design system 6.14). No Post display
  moment here on purpose, and no Caveat anywhere.

  Form image (23 Sep 2026, Ryan's call): Judge.me's modal shows its synced
  image_url, which is the product's FEATURED image, in a 160px square with
  object-fit cover. Mag featured images are portrait flat covers (the /shop
  grid tile), so the crop looked wrong. The swap below is data-driven: when
  the featured image is not square, point jdgm.data.reviewWidget[id].image_url
  at the first SQUARE image the product already has, in this order:
    1. single_mag.media_images[0] (the styled square cover the shop hero,
       PDP and quick-view use)
    2. the first square image in product.media
    3. nothing: Judge.me keeps its default
  Square = aspect ratio 0.9 to 1.1. Products whose featured image is already
  square (Membership) are never touched. Product images are never changed;
  only the value the widget reads. The widget JS reads image_url after this
  inline script has run (verified 23 Sep: the app block sets it synchronously).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign heading = section.settings.heading | default: 'Write a review'
  assign body = section.settings.body
  assign form_only = section.settings.form_only
  assign pt = section.settings.padding_top | default: 48
  assign pb = section.settings.padding_bottom | default: 96
  assign has_app_block = false
  for block in section.blocks
    if block.type == '@app'
      assign has_app_block = true
    endif
  endfor

  # Square form image (see the header comment). Only when the featured image
  # is not already square.
  assign form_image = blank
  assign featured_ratio = product.featured_image.aspect_ratio | default: 1
  if featured_ratio < 0.9 or featured_ratio > 1.1
    assign square_media = product.metafields.single_mag.media_images.value
    assign square_first = square_media | first
    if square_first != blank and square_first.aspect_ratio >= 0.9 and square_first.aspect_ratio <= 1.1
      assign form_image = square_first
    else
      for m in product.media
        if m.media_type == 'image' and m.aspect_ratio >= 0.9 and m.aspect_ratio <= 1.1
          assign form_image = m
          break
        endif
      endfor
    endif
  endif
  assign form_image_url = blank
  if form_image != blank
    assign form_image_url = form_image | image_url: width: 640
  endif
-%}

<section
  class="theinmag-review-form{% if form_only %} theinmag-review-form--form-only{% endif %}"
  id="theinmag-review-form"
  aria-labelledby="theinmag-review-form-heading"
  style="--tmrf-pt: {{ pt }}px; --tmrf-pb: {{ pb }}px;"
  data-theinmag-review-form
  data-form-image="{{ form_image_url }}"
>
  <div class="theinmag-review-form__inner">
    <div class="theinmag-review-form__divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="theinmag-review-form__intro">
      <h2 class="theinmag-review-form__heading" id="theinmag-review-form-heading">{{ heading }}</h2>
      {%- if body != blank -%}
        <p class="theinmag-review-form__body">{{ body }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <div class="theinmag-review-form__widget">
      {%- if has_app_block -%}
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {%- render block -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- else -%}
        {%- comment -%} Judge.me's documented Review Widget Liquid (help article 12058208). {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign has_legacy = false
          if product.metafields.judgeme.widget.size > 20
            assign has_legacy = true
          endif
        -%}
        <div
          id="judgeme_product_reviews"
          class="jdgm-widget jdgm-review-widget"
          data-product-title="{{ product.title | escape }}"
          data-id="{{ product.id }}"
          data-product-id="{{ product.id }}"
          data-widget="review"
          data-auto-install="false"
          data-shop-reviews-count="{{ shop.metafields.judgeme.shop_reviews_count | default: 0 | escape }}"
          data-entry-point="review_widget.js"
          data-entry-key="review-widget/main.js"
        >
          {%- if has_legacy -%}
            <div class="jdgm-legacy-widget-content" style="display: none;">{{ product.metafields.judgeme.widget }}</div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
        {%- if product.metafields.judgeme.review_widget_data -%}
          <script>jdgm.data ||= {}; jdgm.data.reviewWidget ||= {}; jdgm.data.reviewWidget[{{ product.id }}] = {{ product.metafields.judgeme.review_widget_data }}</script>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if form_image_url != blank -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          Rewrite the widget's synced image_url to the square cover. The app
          block above sets jdgm.data.reviewWidget[id] synchronously, so this
          normally lands on the first try; the short retry covers a block that
          defers it. Product images are untouched.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <script>
          (function () {
            var id = {{ product.id | json }};
            var url = {{ form_image_url | json }};
            var tries = 0;
            function apply() {
              var rw = window.jdgm && window.jdgm.data && window.jdgm.data.reviewWidget;
              if (rw && rw[id]) { rw[id].image_url = url; return true; }
              return false;
            }
            if (apply()) return;
            var t = setInterval(function () {
              if (apply() || ++tries > 100) clearInterval(t);
            }, 50);
          })();
        </script>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
  .theinmag-review-form {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    padding: var(--tmrf-pt, 48px) clamp(20px, 5vw, 64px) var(--tmrf-pb, 96px);
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__inner {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    margin: 0 0 clamp(28px, 4vw, 48px);
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__intro {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 0 clamp(20px, 3vw, 32px);
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__heading {
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.4vw, 16px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__body {
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ---------------------------------------------------------------
     Judge.me Review Widget, restyled to the design system.
     Everything below is scoped to this section so it cannot leak
     into theinmag-membership-reviews' own overrides.
     --------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-widget,
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-rev-widg {
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif) !important;
    color: #1a1a1a !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    border: 0 !important;
    background: transparent !important;
    text-align: left !important;
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-rev-widg__header {
    padding: 0 !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    text-align: left !important;
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-rev-widg__title {
    display: none !important;
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-rev-widg__powered-by-text,
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-rev-widg__body-wrap-desktop .jdgm-rev-widg__powered-by-text {
    display: none !important;
  }

  /* ---------------------------------------------------------------
     Judge.me "new version" widget (jm- classes, verified on preview
     22 Sep 2026). The write-a-review form opens as a body-level modal
     (.jdgm-write-review-modal), so the section only owns the trigger.
     --------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jm-review-widget {
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif) !important;
    color: #1a1a1a !important;
    /* Judge.me pads the widget 48px top and bottom; the section owns spacing. */
    padding: 0 !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jm-review-widget__header,
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jm-review-widget-minimal-header {
    padding: 0 !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    border: 0 !important;
  }
  /* Form-only, new widget: hide title, aggregate, sort/filters, media
     strip, review list and pagination. Keep only the action button. */
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jm-review-widget-minimal-header__title,
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jm-average-rating-display,
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jm-review-widget__header > .jm-cluster > .jm-stack:first-child,
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jm-review-widget-minimal-header__filters,
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jm-filters,
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jm-sort-filter,
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jm-media-preview,
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jm-review-widget__body,
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jdgm-review-list,
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jm-pagination-controls {
    display: none !important;
  }
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jm-review-widget__header > .jm-cluster,
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jm-review-widget-minimal-header__filter-container,
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jm-review-widget-minimal-header__button-and-filters {
    display: block !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    justify-content: flex-start !important;
  }
  /* Trigger button: yellow sticker, same recipe as .theinmag-btn--primary. */
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jm-action-buttons__button,
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jm-action-buttons .jm-button--primary {
    display: inline-flex !important;
    align-items: center !important;
    justify-content: center !important;
    width: auto !important;
    max-width: 100% !important;
    flex: 0 0 auto !important;
    font-family: var(--font-heading, 'Post Regular', Georgia, serif) !important;
    font-weight: 400 !important;
    font-size: 14px !important;
    line-height: 1 !important;
    text-transform: uppercase !important;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em !important;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy, #2A1F3D) !important;
    background: var(--color-yellow, #F9C23C) !important;
    border: 0 !important;
    border-radius: var(--radius-button, 32px) !important;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--color-yellow-shadow, #D4A02E) !important;
    padding: 11px 20px !important;
    min-height: 44px;
    margin: 0 !important;
    text-decoration: none !important;
    cursor: pointer !important;
    transition: background-color 0.18s ease, color 0.18s ease, transform 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease;
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jm-action-buttons__button:hover,
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jm-action-buttons__button:focus-visible {
    background: var(--color-purple-dark, #5D3A7A) !important;
    color: #FFFFFF !important;
    transform: translateY(2px);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #4A2D62 !important;
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jm-action-buttons__button:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--color-purple-dark, #5D3A7A);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 990px) {
    /* Same selector list as the base rule: both are !important, so
       specificity decides, and a shorter selector here silently loses. */
    .theinmag-review-form__widget .jm-action-buttons__button,
    .theinmag-review-form__widget .jm-action-buttons .jm-button--primary {
      font-size: 19px !important;
      padding: 16px 32px !important;
    }
  }
  /* The modal is appended to <body>, outside this section. Judge.me's
     branding already sets Inter on headings and copy; inputs and buttons
     fall back to Arial, so bring those into the type system too.
     NEVER the star buttons: each rating star is a <button class="jdgm-star">
     whose glyph is the JudgemeStar icon font set on the button itself (no
     !important), so an !important Inter on every button turned the five
     stars into stacks of bars (found by Ryan 23 Sep 2026). */
  .jdgm-write-review-modal input,
  .jdgm-write-review-modal textarea,
  .jdgm-write-review-modal select,
  .jdgm-write-review-modal button:not(.jdgm-star) {
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif) !important;
  }
  .jdgm-write-review-modal .jdgm-star,
  .jdgm-write-review-modal .jdgm-star::before {
    font-family: JudgemeStar !important;
  }

  /* ---------------------------------------------------------------
     Legacy widget (jdgm-rev-widg classes), kept in case Judge.me serves
     the old markup. Harmless when the new widget renders.
     --------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jdgm-rev-widg__summary,
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jdgm-rev-widg__histogram,
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jdgm-histogram,
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jdgm-rev-widg__sort-wrapper,
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jdgm-rev-widg__filter-wrapper,
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jdgm-rev-widg__filter-buttons,
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jdgm-rev-widg__search,
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jdgm-rev-widg__reviews,
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jdgm-rev-widg__paginate,
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jdgm-paginate,
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jdgm-rev-widg__body-wrap-desktop > :not(.jdgm-form),
  .theinmag-review-form--form-only .jdgm-rev-widg .jdgm-rev {
    display: none !important;
  }

  /* The write-a-review trigger becomes the yellow sticker button.
     One yellow stamp in this section, none in the reviews list above. */
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-write-rev-link {
    display: inline-block !important;
    font-family: var(--font-heading, 'Post Regular', Georgia, serif) !important;
    font-weight: 400 !important;
    font-size: 14px !important;
    line-height: 1 !important;
    text-transform: uppercase !important;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em !important;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy, #2A1F3D) !important;
    background: var(--color-yellow, #F9C23C) !important;
    border: 0 !important;
    border-radius: var(--radius-button, 32px) !important;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--color-yellow-shadow, #D4A02E) !important;
    padding: 11px 20px !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    text-decoration: none !important;
    cursor: pointer !important;
    transition: background-color 0.18s ease, color 0.18s ease, transform 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease;
    float: none !important;
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-write-rev-link:hover,
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-write-rev-link:focus-visible {
    background: var(--color-purple-dark, #5D3A7A) !important;
    color: #FFFFFF !important;
    transform: translateY(2px);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #4A2D62 !important;
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-write-rev-link:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--color-purple-dark, #5D3A7A);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 990px) {
    .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-write-rev-link {
      font-size: 19px !important;
      padding: 16px 32px !important;
    }
  }

  /* The form itself. Judge.me keeps it hidden until the button or a
     token link opens it; we only restyle what it draws. */
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form {
    margin: clamp(20px, 3vw, 28px) 0 0 !important;
    padding: clamp(20px, 3vw, 32px) !important;
    max-width: 640px;
    background: var(--color-cream, #FBF6EA) !important;
    border: 0 !important;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 20px) !important;
    text-align: left !important;
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form label,
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form .jdgm-form__fieldset-label,
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form .jdgm-form__fieldset-title {
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif) !important;
    font-weight: 600 !important;
    font-size: 14px !important;
    color: #1a1a1a !important;
    text-align: left !important;
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form input[type="text"],
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form input[type="email"],
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form input[type="url"],
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form textarea,
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form select {
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif) !important;
    font-size: 16px !important;
    color: #1a1a1a !important;
    background: #FFFFFF !important;
    border: 1px solid rgba(42, 31, 61, 0.22) !important;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md, 12px) !important;
    padding: 12px 14px !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
    min-height: 44px;
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form input:focus,
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form textarea:focus,
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form select:focus {
    border-color: var(--color-purple-dark, #5D3A7A) !important;
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-purple-dark, #5D3A7A);
    outline-offset: 1px;
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form .jdgm-star {
    font-size: 28px !important;
    color: var(--color-yellow, #F9C23C) !important;
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form .jdgm-btn,
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form input[type="submit"],
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form button[type="submit"] {
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif) !important;
    font-weight: 600 !important;
    font-size: 14px !important;
    text-transform: uppercase !important;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em !important;
    border-radius: var(--radius-button, 32px) !important;
    padding: 12px 24px !important;
    min-height: 44px;
    cursor: pointer !important;
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form .jdgm-btn.jdgm-submit-rev,
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form input[type="submit"],
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form button[type="submit"] {
    background: var(--color-purple-dark, #5D3A7A) !important;
    color: #FFFFFF !important;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-purple-dark, #5D3A7A) !important;
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form .jdgm-btn.jdgm-cancel-rev {
    background: transparent !important;
    color: var(--color-purple-dark, #5D3A7A) !important;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-purple-dark, #5D3A7A) !important;
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form .jdgm-btn.jdgm-cancel-rev:hover {
    background: var(--color-purple-dark, #5D3A7A) !important;
    color: #FFFFFF !important;
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form .jdgm-form__submit-btn-wrapper,
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form .jdgm-form__action-btns {
    text-align: left !important;
  }
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form .jdgm-notification,
  .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-form .jdgm-form__success {
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif) !important;
    color: #1a1a1a !important;
    text-align: left !important;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-write-rev-link {
      transition: none;
    }
    .theinmag-review-form__widget .jdgm-write-rev-link:hover {
      transform: none;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Review form (Judge.me)",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "theinmag-review-form-section",
  "enabled_on": {
    "templates": ["product"]
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Hosts the Judge.me Review Widget app block. Review-request links from Klaviyo open this form on load. Add the Judge.me Review Widget block below; if none is added, the section renders the same widget itself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Write a review"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "body",
      "label": "Line under the heading",
      "default": "Tell other families what the mag did for your kid. It takes two minutes and it is the thing parents trust most."
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "form_only",
      "label": "Form only (hide the widget's own review list)",
      "info": "Keep on when the page already shows reviews above this section.",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Spacing"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "label": "Padding top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 48
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "label": "Padding bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 96
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "@app"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Review form (Judge.me)"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
